; Export names must match the game's DllImport EntryPoint values exactly and be
; undecorated. x64 __declspec(dllexport) already yields undecorated names for
; extern "C", but pinning them here makes the ABI contract explicit and stops a
; future calling-convention change from silently renaming an export.
LIBRARY UnityForceFeedback
EXPORTS
    InitDirectInput
    Aquire
    SetDeviceForcesXY
    StartEffect
    StopEffect
    SetAutoCenter
    FreeDirectInput
    SetPreferredDevice
